{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"630881","name":"Vespasiano","description":"يقع فندق Vespasiano البوتيكي الصغير ذو الـ 4 نجوم في قصر تاريخي خلف الفاتيكان. يلتقي العجب المعماري للمبنى بحداثة التصميمات الداخلية، مما يخلق جواً رومانسياً ومعاصراً في الوقت نفسه، مزيناً بإكسسوارات التصميم والحرف اليدوية المصنوعة في إيطاليا. في غرفة الإفطار المشرقة، نقدم كل صباح بوفيه شهي مع منتجات عضوية موسمية: من الفاكهة الطازجة إلى المربيات، ومن الحبوب إلى الكعك الطازج. إذا كنت تفضل ذلك، يسعدنا أن نقدم لك الإفطار في خصوصية غرفتك.","address":"Via Vespasiano, 49","city":"ROMA","countryCode":"IT","postalCode":"00192","lat":41.9079166,"lng":12.4568695,"stars":4,"chain":"LUBOH","giataCode":"597887","phone":"+390691511414","email":"hotelvespasiano@gmail.it","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/63/630881/630881a_hb_a_009_20260218_150415.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/63/630881/630881a_hb_a_013_20260218_150005.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/63/630881/630881a_hb_a_014_20260218_150035.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/63/630881/630881a_hb_a_016_20260218_150124.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/63/630881/630881a_hb_a_017_20260218_150519.jpeg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/63/630881/630881a_hb_l_001.jpg","category":"lobby","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/63/630881/630881a_hb_ro_005.jpg","roomCode":"JSU.DX","category":"room","order":6},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/63/630881/630881a_hb_ro_006.jpg","roomCode":"JSU.DX","category":"room","order":7},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/63/630881/630881a_hb_ro_007.jpg","roomCode":"JSU.DX","category":"room","order":8},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/63/630881/630881a_hb_ro_0